# Kostolany core

- Treat this as **regime recognition / education**, never personalized investment advice.
- Keep `DISCLAIMER_KO` (or equivalent) on any user-facing snapshot/API/UI copy.
- **Never** train on gold/planted/post-hoc labels. Eval-only.
- Prefer extending `src/kostolany/harness/` over ad-hoc backtests that skip purge/embargo/lag.
- Before claiming done: run `python scripts/agent_verify.py` (or skill `kostolany-verify`).
